      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 6 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Shear Line\nIssued at: 8:00 PM, 07 December 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon, Laguna(Liliw, Luisiana, Magdalena, Majayjay, Nagcarlan, Pagsanjan, Rizal, Cavinti, Kalayaan, Lumban, Paete, San Pablo, Santa Cruz, Pila, Victoria, Calauan, Alaminos, Pakil, Pangil, Siniloan, Famy, Santa Maria, Mabitac, Bay, Los Banos) and Rizal(Tanay, Pililla, Jala-Jala).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate rains over Batangas, Cavite, Metro Manila, Laguna(Cabuyao, Calamba, Santa Rosa, Binan, San Pedro), Rizal(Antipolo, Rodriguez, San Mateo, Angono, Baras, Binangonan, Cainta, Cardona, Morong, Taytay, Teresa) and Bulacan(Dona Remedios Trinidad, Norzagaray, San Jose del Monte, Meycauayan, Marilao, Santa Maria, Angat, Pandi, Bocaue, Obando, Bulakan, Balagtas, Guiguinto) within the next 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 11:00 PM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZISbP.",
